2.html"><span>[02:43]</span>\n <p class="author">浮生若朝露</p>\n <p>我堂堂炮灰，会亿点技能很合理吧</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/67155.html"><span>[02:43]</span>\n <p class="author">秃头贝</p>\n <p>我的能力是修改文字描述</p></a></li>\n <li><a href="/shu/52422.html"><span>[02:43]</span>\n <p class="author">白露未晞yz</p>\n <p>据说秦始皇是个女儿控来着</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n <div class="box">\n <div class="title"><a href="/top/goodnum/">热门收藏</a></div>\n <div class="vote">\n <a href="/shu/93531.html">\n <span class="layui-badge">1</span>\n <img src="https://img.110txt.com/93531/1784652.jpg" alt="恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场">\n <p class="bookname">恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场</p>\n <p class="author">莲子呢</p>\n <p class="intro" style="display: -webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp: 4;-webkit-box-orient: vertical;overflow: hidden;text-overflow: ellipsis;">沈棠一觉醒来穿成了三百斤的大胖子，却拥有五个绝色兽夫。\n美艳红狐，霸道黑豹，阴郁白蛇，人鱼暴君，硬汉金鹰上将……各个宽肩窄腰大长腿，八块腹肌堪比男模！\n原主又丑又懒遭人嫌，兽夫们避如蛇蝎，她还妄图霸王硬上弓，穿越过来的沈棠成了这个替罪羔羊。\n开局便是修罗场！面对兽夫冰冷、厌恶的目光，沈棠吓得浑身发抖</p>\n </a>\n </div>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1361.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-orange">2</span>\n <p class="bookname">诸天：从叶问开始的强化之旅</p>\n <p class="author">星空夜竹</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/652.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-green">3</span>\n <p class="bookname">新主播时代</p>\n <p class="author">水墨珊</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/545.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-blue">4</span>\n <p class="bookname">LOL：这是个治愈游戏</p>\n <p class="author">奶茶派教主</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/651.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-cyan">5</span>\n <p class="bookname">三分线真的太近了</p>\n <p class="author">朝沐白鹭</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/361.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">6</span>\n <p class="bookname">许你盛世安宁</p>\n <p class="author">江山一顾</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/389.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">7</span>\n <p class="bookname">从民国长生到港综</p>\n <p class="author">山鬼原</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/565.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">8</span>\n <p class="bookname">精灵之沙暴君王</p>\n <p class="author">小猪题字</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/659.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">9</span>\n <p class="bookname">假面骑士之帝骑临诸天</p>\n <p class="author">若风流雨</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/762.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">10</span>\n <p class="bookname">我在决斗都市玩卡牌</p>\n <p class="author">名称被占用</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1255.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">11</span>\n <p class="bookname">快穿之我只想种田</p>\n <p class="author">沧澜止戈</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/537.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">12</span>\n <p class="bookname">我，沙盒玩家，从聊斋世界开始</p>\n <p class="author">幽冥潜龙</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/292.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">13</span>\n <p class="bookname">人在原神，我真的不是无惨</p>\n <p class="author">带面具的柴犬</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1210.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">14</span>\n <p class="bookname">诸天长生从成为修仙主角开始</p>\n <p class="author">书荒动手写</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/688.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">15</span>\n <p class="bookname">长生从散修开始</p>\n <p class="author">菠菜真的菜</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n</div>\n<form action="/search.html" method="post" class="search">\n\t\t<span><i class="layui-icon i_search"></i><i class="layui-icon i_cancel"></i><input type="text" name="searchkey" placeholder="请输入搜索内容！" /></span>\n\t\t<button class="layui-btn">搜索</button>\n\t</form>\n<div class="footer">\n<p><a href="/shuku/">书库</a> <a href="/sort.html">分类</a> <a href="/zuozhe/">作者</a> <a href="/wanben/">全本</a> <a href="/top/">排行</a></p>\n<